OL,3,GNEWSAFood waste recycling hits 3,500
OL,4,Atonnes in six months
OL,5,
OL,6,FHouseholders have recycled more than
OL,7,F3,500 tonnes of food waste in six
OL,8,Fmonths, a council has said.
OL,10,FThe effort across Bournemouth,
OL,11,FChristchurch and Poole (BCP) has
OL,12,Fresulted in 1,420 more tonnes of food
OL,13,Fwaste being recycled than during the
OL,14,Fsame period last year, says BCP
OL,15,FCouncil.
OL,17,FThe authority said the amount recycled
OL,18,Fis the equivalent weight of about 300
OL,19,Fdouble-decker buses.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
