OL,3,GNEWSAFood waste recycling hits 3,500
OL,4,Atonnes in six months
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt follows the council's expansion of
OL,7,Fweekly food waste collections in April
OL,8,F2026 to all Poole households and flats
OL,9,Fin Bournemouth.
